  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Call ODA Compliant Awards 2017/2018 - Broken Ground: Earthquakes, Colonialism and Nationalism in South Asia, c. 1900-1960</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fellowship award examining earthquake histories in colonial South Asia 1900-1960, and their relationship to social and political change. Beneficiaries: Disaster managers and UK diplomatic and commercial policy makers. SDGs:10,16,9</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
